 "captions": [
  {
   "text": "Your YouTube title is a guess.",
   "start": 0.025,
   "end": 2.145
  },
  {
   "text": "Your viewers already typed the right one.",
   "start": 2.438,
   "end": 4.668
  },
  {
   "text": "You just never looked.",
   "start": 4.937,
   "end": 6.177
  },
  {
   "text": "Open YouTube Studio.",
   "start": 6.988,
   "end": 8.768
  },
  {
   "text": "Go to Content, and pick an old video.",
   "start": 9.059,
   "end": 11.329
  },
  {
   "text": "Click Analytics, then the Reach tab.",
   "start": 12.75,
   "end": 14.85
  },
  {
   "text": "Scroll to the card called YouTube search terms.",
   "start": 15.131,
   "end": 17.931
  },
  {
   "text": "These are the exact words people typed before they found your video.",
   "start": 18.992,
   "end": 22.912
  },
  {
   "text": "Now hold that list next to your title.",
   "start": 23.624,
   "end": 25.954
  },
  {
   "text": "If the top phrase isn't in it,",
   "start": 26.219,
   "end": 27.955
  },
  {
   "text": "there's your problem.",
   "start": 27.955,
   "end": 29.029
  },
  {
   "text": "Put that phrase near the start of the title.",
   "start": 29.725,
   "end": 32.305
  },
  {
   "text": "Only if the video really delivers it.",
   "start": 32.576,
   "end": 34.906
  },
  {
   "text": "Then use that same phrase in the first line of your description.",
   "start": 36.253,
   "end": 39.933
  },
  {
   "text": "Same words people search for.",
   "start": 40.234,
   "end": 41.954
  },
  {
   "text": "Card empty?",
   "start": 42.658,
   "end": 43.598
  },
  {
   "text": "That video barely gets search traffic yet.",
   "start": 43.867,
   "end": 46.347
  },
  {
   "text": "Start with one that does.",
   "start": 46.643,
   "end": 48.013
  },
  {
   "text": "Do this for five old videos this week.",
   "start": 48.792,
   "end": 51.062
  },
  {
   "text": "Change one thing at a time,",
   "start": 51.429,
   "end": 53.015
  },
  {
   "text": "so you know what worked.",
   "start": 53.015,
   "end": 54.239
  },
  {
   "text": "backsurge.com keeps that log for you,",
   "start": 54.921,
   "end": 57.382
  },
  {
   "text": "and shows which change actually moved your views.",
   "start": 57.382,
   "end": 60.311
  }
